    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-στροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπίστρεπτος, αὐχήν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.Byz.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				100.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
				</span></i>
			<i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				79.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eustr.
					<u>in EN</u>
					110.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι ἔχειν</span> to be
				<i>inattentive to,</i> Sophon. <i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				20.34
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				7.10.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κρέμασθαι,</span> of a bat,
				<i><span class="en">
				Trypho
				<u>Trop.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not capable of inversion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				44
			</span></i>.</div>
